  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Planning Frontend Structure**\n\nI\'m currently focused on structuring the `/src/` directory for the frontend. I\'m starting by planning the file organization. Right now, I\'m thinking about the `/src/types/movex.ts` file, where I\'ll be storing shared TypeScript interfaces such as `User`, `PartnerProfile`, `PricingQuote`, and others. This will be the foundational element for my project.\n\n\n**Defining Data Structures**\n\nI\'ve been solidifying the data structures, specifically `Point`, `RouteResult`, `PartnerMatchResult`, and `MeetingPointSuggestion`. Also, the `/src/services/api.ts` file will house a centralized Axios instance with a JWT interceptor, which provides automatic token handling and clean error message extraction. Authentication state, encompassing the `user`, `partnerProfile`, and an `activeActivity` field, will be managed in `/src/context/AuthContext.tsx`. Finally, the critical `MovexMap.tsx` component will use Leaflet with explicit props for map interactions and updates.\n\n\n**Refining UI Components**\n\nI\'m now diving into the UI component details. `/src/components/LocationPicker.tsx` is shaping up to be robust, using request sequence IDs and `AbortController` to handle geocoding race conditions effectively. It includes live search suggestions from OpenStreetMap and MOVEX, test presets, \"Use Current Location\" button with reverse geocoding, and \"Pick on Map\" toggle. It also handles loading and error states explicitly. The `Navbar.tsx` component will adopt a clean 3-zone contract, with a concise top bar, plus a responsive mobile bottom navigation bar.\n\n\n**Designing Landing Pages**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the `/src/pages/LandingPage.tsx` component. I\'m structuring the opening screen with the \"MOVEX\" tagline, user choice cards (\"SEND A PARCEL\" and \"DELIVER A PARCEL\"), and a parcel tracking lookup bar. I\'m also planning the \"How It Works,\" transportation modes, and MOVEX Guard sections. I\'m also planning `/src/pages/AuthPage.tsx` with clean Login and Registration, role choice, and Demo Account buttons.\n\n\n**Expanding Dashboard Structure**\n\nI\'m now expanding the dashboard structure, developing dedicated public pages for \"How It Works\" and \"Safety,\" outlining the details for Community Relay vs. Premium Express, MOVEX Guard, and transportation modes. I\'m focusing on `/src/pages/SenderDashboard.tsx`, with a full sender navigation including the 6-step Booking Wizard, with the first step being Pickup & Destination with `LocationPicker`, Swap button, and the MovexMap. I\'m actively working on Step 3, which encompasses six transportation modes with live price estimates, ETA, and an \"Auto-Find Best Mode\" helper.\n\n\n**Finalizing Booking Flow**\n\nI\'ve significantly progressed on the Booking Wizard. Step 4 encompasses parcel details (exact weight with 15 kg max, dimensions, declared contents, packaging type, photo upload, value, fragile toggle, policy acceptance) plus real-time MOVEX Guard eligibility. Step 5 focuses on partner matching, including ranked matches with compatibility and reliability scores and AI meeting point selection. Finally, Step 6 completes the booking with a summary, QR preview, and simulated payment, resulting in a Digital Parcel Identity.\n\n**Developing Tracking Functionality**\n\nI\'m now deep into `/src/pages/TrackParcelPage.tsx`, which offers both public and authenticated tracking via Parcel ID. I\'m focusing on displaying the Digital Parcel Identity, including the QR code, photo, OTPs for authorized parties, a route map with live/simulated GPS and alerts, a 12-status progress timeline, a meeting point editor, and a dispute filing mechanism.\n\n\n**Constructing Dashboard Components**\n\nI\'m now detailing the partner and admin dashboards. I\'m building `/src/pages/PartnerDashboard.tsx` with comprehensive navigation: journey publishing, parcel requests, active deliveries with auth, earnings, history, and profile management. I am also working on the `/src/pages/AdminDashboard.tsx` component, including user, partner, parcel, delivery, MOVEX Guard, payments, disputes, and analytics sections. I\'m also planning interactive admin actions such as user verification, parcel declaration inspection, MOVEX Guard alert review, refunds and mode fare adjustments, and analytics visualizations.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_8903801077053036834"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export type UserRole = \'sender\' | \'partner\' | \'admin\';\\nexport type TransportMode = \'bike\' | \'car\' | \'bus\' | \'train\' | \'flight\' | \'freight\';\\nexport type DeliveryModel = \'community_relay\' | \'premium_express\';\\nexport type UrgencyLevel = \'standard\' | \'express\' | \'priority\';\\n\\nexport interface User {\\n  id: number;\\n  name: string;\\n  email: string;\\n  mobile: string;\\n  role: UserRole;\\n  can_deliver: number;\\n  verification_status: \'VERIFIED\' | \'PENDING\' | \'SUSPENDED\';\\n  rating: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PartnerProfile {\\n  id: number;\\n  user_id: number;\\n  primary_mode: TransportMode;\\n  vehicle_number: string;\\n  license_verified: number;\\n  max_weight_kg: number;\\n  preferred_corridors: string;\\n  completed_deliveries: number;\\n  on_time_deliveries: number;\\n  cancellations: number;\\n  verified_complaints: number;\\n  handover_compliance_rate: number;\\n  reliability_score: number;\\n  is_available: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface GeoPoint {\\n  name: string;\\n  displayName: string;\\n  lat: number;\\n  lng: number;\\n  source: \'local_index\' | \'nominatim\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface RouteResult {\\n  distanceKm: number;\\n  durationMins: number;\\n  coordinates: [number, number][];\\n  source: \'osrm\' | \'haversine_fallback\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PricingQuote {\\n  mode: TransportMode;\\n  displayName: string;\\n  compatible: boolean;\\n  incompatibilityReasons: string[];\\n  baseFare: number;\\n  distanceCharge: number;\\n  weightCharge: number;\\n  dimensionCharge: number;\\n  modelCharge: number;\\n  urgencyCharge: number;\\n  platformFee: number;\\n  totalPrice: number;\\n  partnerEarning: number;\\n  platformCommission: number;\\n  etaMinutes: number;\\n  etaLabel: string;\\n  integrationStatus: string;\\n  restrictionsSummary: string;\\n  startingPrice: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface GuardEvaluation {\\n  classification: \'PERMITTED\' | \'RESTRICTED\' | \'PROHIBITED\';\\n  riskLevel: \'LOW\' | \'MEDIUM\' | \'HIGH\' | \'CRITICAL\';\\n  reasons: string[];\\n  allowBooking: boolean;\\n  requiresAdminReview: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface MeetingPointSuggestion {\\n  id: string;\\n  type: \'pickup\' | \'dropoff\';\\n  name: string;\\n  landmarkType: string;\\n  lat: number;\\n  lng: number;\\n  reason: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PartnerMatchResult {\\n  journeyId: number | null;\\n  partnerId: number;\\n  partnerName: string;\\n  partnerMobile: string;\\n  transportMode: TransportMode;\\n  vehicleNumber: string;\\n  journeyOrigin: string;\\n  journeyDest: string;\\n  departureTime: string;\\n  expectedArrival: string;\\n  travelDate: string;\\n  availableCapacityCount: number;\\n  maxWeightKg: number;\\n  compatibilityScore: number;\\n  reliabilityScore: number;\\n  etaMinutes: number;\\n  etaLabel: string;\\n  expectedCharge: number;\\n  matchReasons: string[];\\n  preferredMeetingPoints: string[];\\n  isDedicatedExpress: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TrackingEvent {\\n  id: number;\\n  booking_id: number;\\n  status: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  location_name: string;\\n  lat: number | null;\\n  lng: number | null;\\n  actor_name: string;\\n  is_simulated_gps: number;\\n  created_at: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Booking {\\n  id: number;\\n  parcel_code: string;\\n  sender_id: number;\\n  sender_name?: string;\\n  sender_mobile?: string;\\n  partner_id: number | null;\\n  partner_name?: string;\\n  partner_mobile?: string;\\n  partner_vehicle?: string;\\n  partner_reliability?: number;\\n  journey_id: number | null;\\n  delivery_model: DeliveryModel;\\n  transport_mode: TransportMode;\\n  urgency: UrgencyLevel;\\n  pickup_location: string;\\n  pickup_lat: number;\\n  pickup_lng: number;\\n  destination_location: string;\\n  destination_lat: number;\\n  destination_lng: number;\\n  distance_km: number;\\n  eta_minutes: number;\\n  eta_label: string;\\n  parcel_category: string;\\n  weight_kg: number;\\n  length_cm: number;\\n  width_cm: number;\\n  height_cm: number;\\n  declared_contents: string;\\n  declared_value: number;\\n  is_fragile: number;\\n  packaging_type: string;\\n  parcel_photo_url: string;\\n  guard_classification: \'PERMITTED\' | \'RESTRICTED\' | \'PROHIBITED\';\\n  guard_notes: string;\\n  pickup_meeting_point: string;\\n  dropoff_meeting_point: string;\\n  meeting_agreed_by_sender: number;\\n  meeting_agreed_by_partner: number;\\n  base_fare: number;\\n  distance_charge: number;\\n  weight_charge: number;\\n  dimension_charge: number;\\n  model_charge: number;\\n  urgency_charge: number;\\n  platform_fee: number;\\n  total_price: number;\\n  partner_earning: number;\\n  platform_commission: number;\\n  status: string;\\n  pickup_otp: string;\\n  handover_otp: string;\\n  delivery_otp: string;\\n  current_lat: number | null;\\n  current_lng: number | null;\\n  route_deviation_alert: number;\\n  created_at: string;\\n  updated_at: string;\\n  trackingEvents?: TrackingEvent[];\\n  payment?: Payment | null;\\n  disputes?: Dispute[];\\n  securityAlerts?: SecurityAlert[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Journey {\\n  id: number;\\n  partner_id: number;\\n  origin_name: string;\\n  origin_lat: number;\\n  origin_lng: number;\\n  dest_name: string;\\n  dest_lat: number;\\n  dest_lng: number;\\n  travel_date: string;\\n  departure_time: string;\\n  expected_arrival: string;\\n  transport_mode: TransportMode;\\n  available_capacity_count: number;\\n  max_weight_kg: number;\\n  preferred_meeting_points: string;\\n  is_recurring: number;\\n  recurrence_rule: string;\\n  status: \'ACTIVE\' | \'PAUSED\' | \'COMPLETED\' | \'CANCELLED\';\\n  declaration_confirmed: number;\\n  created_at: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Payment {\\n  id: number;\\n  booking_id: number;\\n  parcel_code?: string;\\n  sender_name?: string;\\n  partner_name?: string;\\n  pickup_location?: string;\\n  destination_location?: string;\\n  transport_mode?: string;\\n  booking_status?: string;\\n  amount: number;\\n  platform_commission: number;\\n  partner_earning: number;\\n  method: string;\\n  transaction_ref: string;\\n  status: \'PENDING\' | \'COMPLETED\' | \'ON_HOLD\' | \'REFUNDED\' | \'PARTIAL_REFUND\';\\n  is_simulated: number;\\n  created_at: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Dispute {\\n  id: number;\\n  booking_id: number;\\n  parcel_code?: string;\\n  total_price?: number;\\n  raised_by_id: number;\\n  raised_by_name?: string;\\n  reason: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  status: \'OPEN\' | \'UNDER_REVIEW\' | \'RESOLVED_REFUND\' | \'RESOLVED_RELEASE\';\\n  resolution_note: string;\\n  created_at: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SecurityAlert {\\n  id: number;\\n  booking_id: number;\\n  parcel_code?: string;\\n  declared_contents?: string;\\n  declared_value?: number;\\n  weight_kg?: number;\\n  transport_mode?: string;\\n  pickup_location?: string;\\n  destination_location?: string;\\n  booking_status?: string;\\n  sender_name?: string;\\n  sender_email?: string;\\n  user_id: number;\\n  risk_level: \'LOW\' | \'MEDIUM\' | \'HIGH\' | \'CRITICAL\';\\n  classification: string;\\n  reasons_json: string;\\n  status: \'OPEN\' | \'APPROVED\' | \'REJECTED\' | \'INFO_REQUESTED\' | \'ESCALATED\';\\n  admin_decision_note: string;\\n  created_at: string;\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Define shared frontend TypeScript models for MOVEX in src/types/movex.ts\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/movex.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating TypeScript types\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create TypeScript types\"}"
