  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Parcel Booking**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the \"How It Works\" and \"Safety\" pages, along with the core 6-step Booking Wizard component. Currently, I\'m setting up explicit state management for pickup and destination details, including precise location coordinates.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_335185236300924042"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { Link } from \'react-router-dom\';\\nimport { ArrowRight, CheckCircle2, MapPin, ShieldCheck, Smartphone, Users } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\nexport default function HowItWorksPage() {\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-3xl\\\">\\n        <h1 className=\\\"font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#101114] sm:text-4xl\\\">\\n          How MOVEX Works\\n        </h1>\\n        <p className=\\\"mt-3 text-base text-[#777777]\\\">\\n          MOVEX connects senders with verified travellers and multi-modal transport partners using existing journeys, smart meeting points, and OTP-authenticated handovers.\\n        </p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-4\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-[#F5F5F5] p-5\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#FFD43B] font-display text-base font-extrabold text-[#101114]\\\">\\n            01\\n          </div>\\n          <h2 className=\\\"font-display mt-4 text-base font-bold text-[#101114]\\\">Set Route & Model</h2>\\n          <p className=\\\"mt-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#777777]\\\">\\n            Choose pickup and destination on the interactive OpenStreetMap. Pick affordable Community Relay or doorstep Premium Express.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-[#F5F5F5] p-5\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#FFD43B] font-display text-base font-extrabold text-[#101114]\\\">\\n            02\\n          </div>\\n          <h2 className=\\\"font-display mt-4 text-base font-bold text-[#101114]\\\">Mode & Declaration</h2>\\n          <p className=\\\"mt-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#777777]\\\">\\n            Compare live backend pricing across Bike, Car, Bus, Train, Flight, and Commercial Freight. Declare contents honestly\342\200\224no special seals needed.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-[#F5F5F5] p-5\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#FFD43B] font-display text-base font-extrabold text-[#101114]\\\">\\n            03\\n          </div>\\n          <h2 className=\\\"font-display mt-4 text-base font-bold text-[#101114]\\\">AI Route Match</h2>\\n          <p className=\\\"mt-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#777777]\\\">\\n            MOVEX Intelligence scores existing journeys out of 100 and suggests safe public meeting hubs where both parties agree to meet.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-[#F5F5F5] p-5\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#FFD43B] font-display text-base font-extrabold text-[#101114]\\\">\\n            04\\n          </div>\\n          <h2 className=\\\"font-display mt-4 text-base font-bold text-[#101114]\\\">OTP Custody & Track</h2>\\n          <p className=\\\"mt-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#777777]\\\">\\n            Every parcel receives a Digital QR Identity plus Pickup, Handover, and Recipient Delivery OTPs for verified end-to-end custody.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"rounded-3xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n            <Users className=\\\"h-6 w-6 text-[#101114]\\\" />\\n            <h2 className=\\\"font-display text-xl font-bold text-[#101114]\\\">Community Relay Rules</h2>\\n          </div>\\n          <ul className=\\\"mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-[#777777]\\\">\\n            <li className=\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\">\\n              <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#101114]\\\" />\\n              <span>Uses existing journeys only\342\200\224partners must confirm they are already travelling on the route.</span>\\n            </li>\\n            <li className=\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\">\\n              <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#101114]\\\" />\\n              <span>No dedicated journey is ever created solely for a Community Relay parcel.</span>\\n            </li>\\n            <li className=\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\">\\n              <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#101114]\\\" />\\n              <span>AI suggests public transit stands & landmarks so sender and partner mutually agree on handoff points.</span>\\n            </li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"rounded-3xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n            <Smartphone className=\\\"h-6 w-6 text-[#101114]\\\" />\\n            <h2 className=\\\"font-display text-xl font-bold text-[#101114]\\\">Simulated vs Live Scope</h2>\\n          </div>\\n          <ul className=\\\"mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-[#777777]\\\">\\n            <li className=\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\">\\n              <MapPin className=\\\"mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#101114]\\\" />\\n              <span>OpenStreetMap Nominatim & OSRM provide real geocoding and route geometry; GPS progress updates are clearly marked as simulated prototype feeds.</span>\\n            </li>\\n            <li className=\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\">\\n              <ShieldCheck className=\\\"mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#101114]\\\" />\\n              <span>Bus, Train, Flight, and Commercial Freight carrier dispatches are clearly labeled as simulated operator workflows.</span>\\n            </li>\\n            <li className=\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\">\\n              <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#101114]\\\" />\\n              <span>Payments and partner payouts are simulated INR ledger transactions for hackathon demonstration.</span>\\n            </li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3\\\">\\n        <Link\\n          to=\\\"/sender?tab=book\\\"\\n          className=\\\"inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#FFD43B] px-6 text-sm font-bold text-[#101114] hover:bg-[#F5C419]\\\"\\n        >\\n          <span>Send a Parcel</span>\\n          <ArrowRight className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n        </Link>\\n        <Link\\n          to=\\\"/partner\\\"\\n          className=\\\"inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#101114] px-6 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#25282D]\\\"\\n        >\\n          <span>Deliver a Parcel</span>\\n        </Link>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create HowItWorksPage explaining Community Relay, Premium Express, and prototype scope in src/pages/HowItWorksPage.tsx\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/pages/HowItWorksPage.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating HowItWorksPage\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create HowItWorksPage\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\373\v\n\370\v\001i\024}\023O\026\024L\342Fd\260I\233j\237\033#\253\020\321\0237\321 \372\202\323\351XB\224_\t\360\f\357\322\242\034\275\310{\276\306z\212\323/\233\277\001\353\3023\237/\274\232\344\322k\206\017\370\021\244\232\376k\204\372m\336:\227\302\252O\336\250\2544;\017\243\341\373QO\221a\250\020n\311~\314lS\373H\224\226F0\247\240\343\270\257\324\322\315Z\235\030\301\33569\213\207\2671\261\343\375\302\360\0220\251\235\220\320\fx\257\031)\022\307\305\335\247?\220\330\366\344\037\3429\033\335`\303\301G\213&\006\363]\271w9X\224%\3252x<c\227\303\271}Y\332\355\307\345M\243\304#%[\321H\223N}\241~\345\331\211\363\214Z\027\027\376\222\217T\351\252\336Xr\3048\260\206=\302W\232\037\355\v\301w\'Bs`\233\264d\277\236O9\247\t~\3662\032\355g\005\311\277\\\250\215Y\375m\t\327\243%]H\331\350\377\276\177\313se\275o\212\364\376~J\376\345\256\374\000\353 \240\367\311\313\234oY\277\364\311r\304\273\202r\027f\240\331Xh`\351\3351\300\315\235\302\345Q\233\256x\21405\017\307\350\bp\n\2422\0303\226\037p\177\232e\231\332\302=s{\030\034\265\2709\303\266we\263!W,Gh\356\316\330\363\204\213\031\0357y\261\376\331]\205RP8\\\250\307R\032\004\2744\032n\240\366\355q\016}\370%\001\264b\360\324\344[\024\354x{\205X\3700\370\314\320R\351\266gH\004\247[\f19W\301\252\240<\265\214d\252\312\020A2V\343\335D\213;x\233\231\001\214\a\205[\247M\337\311/c\b\360XZC\251\232\205l\024H\232\003s\305\306\241\305\230\201_\004\030\003\311p{@\244\342\272\035d\2372\272^(\265,\034\327)\264\333\231,\245\274\037\266\332\3330\273\251\002\375%\026_\312|\032\024\231V\226\320\004E6\370\200\365%,en\300\241\326\"uE\363\023x\a\316\004\307t\177\025\217\023\370$A\203b\223v2G\255D<\332yuXO\275\246S\355\302)\f\025\3219\322P\230\327\371}\353W\334\362\352\272AL\370\302\343\316\323\254\371\213\031\203v\031\373\273T\264\340\250T\034>\232\266<?\031\206\331o\277\365\356\253>X\275\271\300DI\271\212\340\337\3614\270?\365\267\366\257\200n\272\223\205\202q\024\036f\020\267\342)g\244\325\a\022\272\260\217\302\233\235\373$F\266\222\344\262w\031\307\222m\2019\250\337\v\260\3168rk&\322m\2222\251\002\243\272I\216\304i\342\\\r\254\334\230\345=\244\033\35347(4\332\b!\017\203\203\'\025\243\216\020\t\341F\206\313\343A!M\353,\341\354S\362\274h\017\306\242\253r\226E\371\177qz\270v>\234}B0\002\322\346\354NfC\331\365:r\004\375\\\312!*\373\256\316.$A\361\314\v\375\374\215>\205\\\302\'\030\f\221\216\030KQ\0055\r+}\260\234\3436\202\035EI\035D.>\327\003x\236\037HI+F\205\300\005\321\326\262?[\312\\\321\217\260F\366J\317\215;\315\363\205m\370\026\030m\350k\376\207\000\265\022\001\256d\325\005:\203\362J\244\263\271\211\212\341\210\335\b\221I\001\373\363\332H5\304\337\037\027;\377\020\026\363qn\310\376\r\352\000LCm\330\332\t\001\374\023\277\rF\035\324<\232Y\215s\206\345\030f\355\265\025\003-\225\001]\264&\307\342b\264\241\332\023~\353\002\001\274j\366\303\317\313\251\2136\303u\350\210 \002\240\253\222IV\242\314V\261\350\362|\304\\6\371\266\260\202\344\200q\275[\232\243B\002\300\357a\244\326\301\312\234\346QV\203\214\350\2344\217\262\230\362\332lAB9.\214{t&Q\377\375\345\370\r\201\342\207\t\236\025\264\246\373\\?\375\001\332\250!\201\212\021d\230\343\325\036[\332\2470\217Y\2350\325\036\203\372Pb\270\346\323H\300\252\314\252Ep_\364\0353\n@y\020\246\333\213\352\363\364\315SJ\a\203\325\332\360\376\277\002\253\361\212\006r\325\265hg\243\337\315\213\037\300\312i=\365#J\022\220\207\035\267\270\357a\3304c\356w\206\276\342\314\021\376j&\345\202\224\263\320\227\304\305\267q\203\033\221e\213\212\270\002\n\324M)\301\033\270\363\273U\021\210B\036\371\220\200\363\300\373\313\362\240\004B\243\303\217\211\335\346{\247\0251\377\247|K\265(\261\230\371\243\222\037\2317\027\211\270\f\270\315Bf!\366\214\226P[qK\v\243\020\350\361\216\246\316n \352\016\034a\341d4y\311tY\227~\326\215\r\227Sz\275\004vr,\223\371\273\373l\211\355\256\350XQ\342VH\266\035\372\246=\356>\256*>\346\265\020\237\366\276\364\t\032$h\213\213}\222T\017T\305\026\030\022h\032#>Go3s\253v\324,\254\261\216\034\213\274\276\f\ak\362~\267,M\r\230o\347\331\022B\346}\327\270-Z\006\370\340U\n\344\207\205\177\200\022+\323^\332@\266\234\0354Fx\323N\360\316\177A\037\275d\256qpb$\037\317\245\\\206\223\361\2315\033\216 \254}\253\017o\202\266\252\327\310em-Z\263\324`9ufT\221\253n\270\337\005y\251X8\272\362\365\243\363\261Z\303->\330]\243\262\277I\343\275\263:k?\316p\371x\240:\304f\ar\335\206\203\377\177\275\2743\250\347/\262YksF\227\347\rz~RT\016\253\345\256\b\242\244\351\207\260\350\301\206m\334\207\304\364\263V\343\016\227\273y\301\210\f<\246p=\244\033\216\\\022V|\232)\324"
      original_name: "write_to_file"
