              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "          Every active delivery uses three distinct OTPs\342\200\224<strong className=\"text-[#101114]\">Pickup OTP</strong>, <strong className=\"text-[#101114]\">Relay Handover OTP</strong>, and <strong className=\"text-[#101114]\">Recipient Delivery OTP</strong>\342\200\224recorded in a timestamped custody ledger."
