  planner_response {
    response: "The full-stack **MOVEX \342\200\224 Moving Things Together** application has been implemented, redesigned with a Rapido-inspired minimalist interface (`#101114`, `#FFFFFF`, `#FFD43B`, `#F5F5F5`, `#25282D`, `#777777`), and verified end-to-end.\n\n### Implemented Architecture & Features\n\n1. **Opening Screen & Activity Switching**\n   - Clean landing experience presenting **\"What would you like to do today?\"** with **Send a Parcel** and **Deliver a Parcel** cards, plus instant Parcel ID tracking and overviews of both delivery models and six transportation modes.\n   - Authenticated users can switch seamlessly between **Send a Parcel** and **Deliver a Parcel** workspaces from their dashboard sidebar/header.\n\n2. **Authentication, RBAC & Demo Accounts**\n   - JWT authentication with `bcryptjs` password hashing, password strength validation, and role-based route protection (`sender`, `partner`, `admin`) backed by SQLite (`movex.db`).\n   - Built-in 1-click demo login buttons on `/auth`:\n     - **Sender**: `sender@movex.demo` / `Movex@123`\n     - **Partner**: `partner@movex.demo` / `Movex@123`\n     - **Admin**: `admin@movex.demo` / `Movex@123`\n\n3. **Map & Geocoding Accuracy Fix**\n   - Separate state for `pickupLocation`, `pickupLatitude`, `pickupLongitude`, `destinationLocation`, `destinationLatitude`, and `destinationLongitude`.\n   - Race-condition-safe OpenStreetMap Nominatim search + local Goa/India hub index (`Panaji`, `Margao`, `Vasco da Gama`, `Mapusa`, `Ponda`, `Mumbai`, `Pune`, etc.), geolocation support, manual map-tap pin placement, location swap, and OSRM route geometry with deterministic Leaflet marker & `fitBounds` updates.\n\n4. **Six-Step Sender Booking & Centralized Dynamic Pricing**\n   - Centralized backend pricing engine (`server/pricing.ts`) supporting **Bike** (\342\202\27130 base), **Car** (\342\202\27150 base), **Bus** (\342\202\27140 base), **Train** (\342\202\27160 base), **Flight** (\342\202\271150 base), and **Commercial Freight** (\342\202\271100 base).\n   - Live price updates whenever route distance, mode, weight (up to 15 kg prototype cap), dimensions, delivery model (`Community Relay` vs `Premium Express`), or urgency change.\n   - Supports ordinary packaging (envelopes, paper wrapping, cardboard boxes), parcel photo uploads, and simulated INR payment confirmation.\n\n5. **Delivery Partner Hub & Atomic Parcel Locking**\n   - **\"SHARE YOUR JOURNEY\"** form with interactive route map, recurring journey scheduling, pause/resume/delete controls, and mandatory existing-journey declaration.\n   - Matching parcel requests ranked by corridor compatibility, with **atomic SQLite transaction locking** so two partners cannot claim the same broadcast parcel.\n   - Pickup OTP, Relay Handover OTP, Recipient Delivery OTP, simulated GPS progress & route-deviation testing, and **Recharts** earnings analytics.\n\n6. **MOVEX Intelligence, MOVEX Guard, Tracking & Admin Console**\n   - **MOVEX Intelligence** (`server/intelligence.ts`): `0\342\200\223100` route compatibility scoring, ETA prediction, partner reliability scoring, and smart public meeting-point suggestions.\n   - **MOVEX Guard**: Classifies declarations (`PERMITTED`, `RESTRICTED`, `PROHIBITED`), flags high-value/air-battery/frequency anomalies for admin review, and logs audit decisions (`APPROVED`, `REJECTED`, `INFO_REQUESTED`, `ESCALATED`).\n   - **Digital Parcel Identity**: Unique Parcel ID (`MVX-YYYY-XXXX`), QR code, 12-status custody timeline, mutual meeting-point coordination, disputes with simulated payment holds, and simulated refunds.\n   - **Admin Dashboard**: Role-restricted overview, user/partner verification & suspension, parcel inspection, MOVEX Guard review queue, FinTech ledger, dispute resolution, and Recharts analytics.\n\n### Verification Summary\n- **Build & Typecheck**: `npm run build` and `npm run lint` (`tsc --noEmit`) passed with zero errors.\n- **API & Workflow Tests**: Verified live against `http://localhost:3000/api/*` across geocoding/routing (`Panaji \342\206\222 Margao`, `Vasco \342\206\222 Mapusa`, `Ponda \342\206\222 Panaji`, `Mapusa \342\206\222 Margao`), dynamic pricing scaling by weight/mode/distance, RBAC isolation (`403` on non-admin access), end-to-end booking + atomic duplicate-accept lock (`409` conflict) + OTP completion (`DELIVERED`), and MOVEX Guard alert review.\n\n### Running Locally\n```bash\nnpm install\nnpm run dev\n```\nThe full-stack Express + Vite server runs on `http://localhost:3000`. For production:\n```bash\nnpm run build\nnpm start\n```"
    modified_response: "The full-stack **MOVEX \342\200\224 Moving Things Together** application has been implemented, redesigned with a Rapido-inspired minimalist interface (`#101114`, `#FFFFFF`, `#FFD43B`, `#F5F5F5`, `#25282D`, `#777777`), and verified end-to-end.\n\n### Implemented Architecture & Features\n\n1. **Opening Screen & Activity Switching**\n   - Clean landing experience presenting **\"What would you like to do today?\"** with **Send a Parcel** and **Deliver a Parcel** cards, plus instant Parcel ID tracking and overviews of both delivery models and six transportation modes.\n   - Authenticated users can switch seamlessly between **Send a Parcel** and **Deliver a Parcel** workspaces from their dashboard sidebar/header.\n\n2. **Authentication, RBAC & Demo Accounts**\n   - JWT authentication with `bcryptjs` password hashing, password strength validation, and role-based route protection (`sender`, `partner`, `admin`) backed by SQLite (`movex.db`).\n   - Built-in 1-click demo login buttons on `/auth`:\n     - **Sender**: `sender@movex.demo` / `Movex@123`\n     - **Partner**: `partner@movex.demo` / `Movex@123`\n     - **Admin**: `admin@movex.demo` / `Movex@123`\n\n3. **Map & Geocoding Accuracy Fix**\n   - Separate state for `pickupLocation`, `pickupLatitude`, `pickupLongitude`, `destinationLocation`, `destinationLatitude`, and `destinationLongitude`.\n   - Race-condition-safe OpenStreetMap Nominatim search + local Goa/India hub index (`Panaji`, `Margao`, `Vasco da Gama`, `Mapusa`, `Ponda`, `Mumbai`, `Pune`, etc.), geolocation support, manual map-tap pin placement, location swap, and OSRM route geometry with deterministic Leaflet marker & `fitBounds` updates.\n\n4. **Six-Step Sender Booking & Centralized Dynamic Pricing**\n   - Centralized backend pricing engine (`server/pricing.ts`) supporting **Bike** (\342\202\27130 base), **Car** (\342\202\27150 base), **Bus** (\342\202\27140 base), **Train** (\342\202\27160 base), **Flight** (\342\202\271150 base), and **Commercial Freight** (\342\202\271100 base).\n   - Live price updates whenever route distance, mode, weight (up to 15 kg prototype cap), dimensions, delivery model (`Community Relay` vs `Premium Express`), or urgency change.\n   - Supports ordinary packaging (envelopes, paper wrapping, cardboard boxes), parcel photo uploads, and simulated INR payment confirmation.\n\n5. **Delivery Partner Hub & Atomic Parcel Locking**\n   - **\"SHARE YOUR JOURNEY\"** form with interactive route map, recurring journey scheduling, pause/resume/delete controls, and mandatory existing-journey declaration.\n   - Matching parcel requests ranked by corridor compatibility, with **atomic SQLite transaction locking** so two partners cannot claim the same broadcast parcel.\n   - Pickup OTP, Relay Handover OTP, Recipient Delivery OTP, simulated GPS progress & route-deviation testing, and **Recharts** earnings analytics.\n\n6. **MOVEX Intelligence, MOVEX Guard, Tracking & Admin Console**\n   - **MOVEX Intelligence** (`server/intelligence.ts`): `0\342\200\223100` route compatibility scoring, ETA prediction, partner reliability scoring, and smart public meeting-point suggestions.\n   - **MOVEX Guard**: Classifies declarations (`PERMITTED`, `RESTRICTED`, `PROHIBITED`), flags high-value/air-battery/frequency anomalies for admin review, and logs audit decisions (`APPROVED`, `REJECTED`, `INFO_REQUESTED`, `ESCALATED`).\n   - **Digital Parcel Identity**: Unique Parcel ID (`MVX-YYYY-XXXX`), QR code, 12-status custody timeline, mutual meeting-point coordination, disputes with simulated payment holds, and simulated refunds.\n   - **Admin Dashboard**: Role-restricted overview, user/partner verification & suspension, parcel inspection, MOVEX Guard review queue, FinTech ledger, dispute resolution, and Recharts analytics.\n\n### Verification Summary\n- **Build & Typecheck**: `npm run build` and `npm run lint` (`tsc --noEmit`) passed with zero errors.\n- **API & Workflow Tests**: Verified live against `http://localhost:3000/api/*` across geocoding/routing (`Panaji \342\206\222 Margao`, `Vasco \342\206\222 Mapusa`, `Ponda \342\206\222 Panaji`, `Mapusa \342\206\222 Margao`), dynamic pricing scaling by weight/mode/distance, RBAC isolation (`403` on non-admin access), end-to-end booking + atomic duplicate-accept lock (`409` conflict) + OTP completion (`DELIVERED`), and MOVEX Guard alert review.\n\n### Running Locally\n```bash\nnpm install\nnpm run dev\n```\nThe full-stack Express + Vite server runs on `http://localhost:3000`. For production:\n```bash\nnpm run build\nnpm start\n```"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\374\002\n\371\002\001i\024}\023J\371\261&\211Q\275\252\335\346o\221\370<\"\210\334[\031n\377~\244\234P\373\236\254\355\253\211\375r\211\261\353h\020\240\253\276\342\277\3708\256\246^\350@\265\327\035\"S\215\235\215\bP\fW2\004\251\225\314\307\303#\003a`\\y\206^\310\343\016{xk\333Zr\f\235\244\371\245\232\230.6\3639\020\205\360\301\363\304\366+\272\026\374\023A\362\304\273J\372A_\365\255\203\253\267\220\311\364\325\227\025\306$#\352+1\024\345K\373{%\260\241=\201\313!\032\027\333\254\343\341\351U8\371\024\224\2006\207\231o\347k\202\262\271\244\270\365U\004W\037\3268\343r\215R\314!\313\"\035\215)P^p\344\230\020g\220\263\260\3768\274U\332\030\260\037\021xd\373\232\247{7E\026\315\210r\272\257E\220nN\300\352\032}\032\315\262\264\v\027$zt;n\316jZ7!\215\251\\\227~a\271\327\3215\030}Y0J/\004<\016\221|\220\'|\314\r|\bI7\212@\307*Hl\363\225\217\377\277\023\223\221LN@\307\241o,5\224\027\336=J\366\211\255\037VcX\231\331[\333\231\352R\3679\272\275\017\374x\334*\320\224\332J\227\212:\214\214K\3727\004D\256\357\367\263\223g\253Z\265q\247n\314\035n\302\021\327\333<\265Z\216\232\232\031\026\326\377\327\301uo"
